,p_list_template_noncurrent=>'<li class="amc-TBrutalLinks-item"><a class="amc-TBrutalLinks-card" href="#LINK#"><span class="amc-TBrutalLinks-icon fa #ICON_CSS_CLASSES#" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="amc-TBrutalLinks-text"><span class="amc-TBrutalLinks-label">#TEXT#</span><span class="amc-TBrutalLinks-desc">#A01#</span></span><span class="amc-TBrutalLinks-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></li>'
,p_list_template_name=>'AMC Brutal Links'
,p_internal_name=>'AMC_TPL_BRUTAL_LINKS'
,p_theme_id=>42
,p_css_file_urls=>'#APP_FILES#amc-templates/amc-tpl-brutal-links.css'
,p_a01_label=>'Description'
,p_list_template_comment=>'List template that renders each entry as a neo-brutalist card: a thick border in the theme''s text color, a hard offset shadow (mirrored in right-to-left languages), a flat tinted fill that cycles through the primary, warning, success, danger and a warning-danger orange palette tint, the entry icon in a square badge and a large arrow. Hover lifts the card, clicking presses it flat into its shadow. The current entry is inverted. Use the Description attribute (A01) for one or two lines of explanation. Template options: Sticker tilt rotates the cards slightly like stickers, Monochrome drops the rotating fills, Rows lays entries out as full-width rows, and Heavy uses thicker borders and deeper shadows. Keyboard focus shows the same lift as hover plus a focus ring. Under reduced motion cards change without movement; in forced-colors mode shadows are replaced by system borders.'
);
end;
